graph TD
    A[Start: User clicks Sync] --> B{Remote branch exists?}
    B -->|Yes| C[git pull --rebase origin main]
    B -->|No| D[Skip pull, will create branch]
    C --> E{Pull succeeded?}
    E -->|Yes| F[Merge remote changes]
    E -->|No - conflict| G[Abort rebase]
    G --> H[Local takes precedence]
    H --> F
    D --> F
    F --> I[git add -A]
    I --> J{Anything to commit?}
    J -->|Yes| K[git commit -m 'thinkingkity vault sync']
    J -->|No| L[Already up to date]
    K --> M[git push origin main]
    M --> N{Push succeeded?}
    N -->|Yes| O[Sync complete]
    N -->|No| P[git push --force origin main]
    P --> O
    L --> O
